# Jak II holsters on the simulated headset (run with JAKVR_TEST_GUN=1 JAKVR_BODY_TRACE=1: the gun given, each round
# logged as "[vr-gun] a round fired"): a new game to the fortress exit (as jak2_play.sim); the right hand to the hip,
# the right grip squeezed there (the gun drawn, no shot: "[vr-pad] holster: the right grip squeezed"), brought ahead and
# let go (the gun stays out), a shot with the trigger, then the hand over the right shoulder, gripped and let go there
# (the gun put away), and drawn again from the shoulder.
# Zones (jak_vr.cpp at_holster, the hand from the head): the hip below 45 cm, 8 cm out to its side, not 25 cm ahead;
# the shoulder above -25 cm, 2 cm behind, within 35 cm across. The right hand rests at (0.2, -0.35, -0.3).
